# Switch to the PCB tab. Pins two fixes at once:
#  - process-all used to rebuild the state with as-tab = st.as-tab (the OLD
#    state), so set-tab's result was discarded every frame and a tab click
#    could never do anything.
#  - the PCB view draws past triangle 16384, which codex-vm used to drop
#    silently, taking the status bar and the tab bar with it.

boot 8000
click 110 40
settle 1500
